# The context of the TrueNAS add-on's image (addons/truenas/Dockerfile): only
# its own module and the strictjson module its go.mod replaces. Without this it
# also carried the 9.5 MB binary a local `go build` leaves behind, shipped
# into the image and then overwritten by the one the builder produces.
*
!strictjson
!truenas
truenas/truenas
**/*.test
**/*.db
**/*.log
**/*.log.*
